## How **ggplot2** works?

* The **ggplot2** structures works as follows...

```r
ggplot(data = <DATA>, 
       mapping = aes(x = <x-VARIABLE>, y = <y-VARIABLE>)) +
   <GEOM_FUNCTION>() +
   <OTHER_FUNCTIONS>()
```

Alternative structure...

```r
ggplot(data = <DATA>) +
   <GEOM_FUNCTION>( mapping = aes(x = <x-VARIABLE>, y = <y-VARIABLE>)) +
   <OTHER_FUNCTIONS>()
```

* **mapping** defines how the variables should be mapped on the different parts of the plot. 

::: {style="font-size: 30px;"}
Learn more here [ggplot2.tidyverse.org](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/)
:::


