## Analyzing Anscombe Quartet
::: footer
EDA - Visualization: Uni-Variate Numeric
:::

```{r, echo=TRUE}
library(Tmisc) # loading Tmisc

quartet %>%
  group_by(set) %>% # grouping the data by set
  summarise( 
    mean_x = mean(x), mean_y = mean(y),
    sd_x = sd(x), sd_y = sd(y),
    r = cor(x, y)
  ) # summarizing main stats
```


