##  Position Adjustment: Maps

::::: {style="font-size:30px;"}

You can use maps for your plots, and with `coord_quickmap()` it will compute the accurate ratio for the maps.


:::: {.columns}

::: column
```{r, echo=T}
library(maps)
nz <- map_data("nz")

ggplot(nz, aes(long, lat, group = group)) +
  geom_polygon(fill = "white", 
               colour = "black")
```

:::

::: column

```{r, echo=T}
#| code-line-numbers: "4"
ggplot(nz, aes(long, lat, group = group)) +
  geom_polygon(fill = "white", 
               colour = "black") +
  coord_quickmap()
```

:::

