##  Position Adjustment

:::: {style="font-size:30px;"}

**coord_polar()** 

:::: {.columns}

::: column
```{r, echo=T}
ggplot(diamonds) +
  geom_bar(
    aes(x = cut, fill=cut),
    show.legend = F,
    width = 1
  ) +
  theme(aspect.ratio = 1) +
  labs(x=NULL, y=NULL) +
  coord_flip()
```

:::

::: column
```{r, echo=T}
#| code-line-numbers: "9"
ggplot(diamonds) +
  geom_bar(
    aes(x = cut, fill=cut),
    show.legend = F,
    width = 1
  ) +
  theme(aspect.ratio = 1) +
  labs(x=NULL, y=NULL) +
  coord_polar()
```

:::

